; Materialization corpus: a literal default lands on the overlay for an
; omitted key. Host.validateDocument runs ManifestLoader → aggregate
; validators → Validator.validate → materializeDefaults; the omitted
; `:radius` on `(circle)` becomes a `literal_default` overlay entry
; carrying 32. Conformance asserts on the diagnostic stream only — the
; overlay itself is host-private state. Zero diagnostics expected.
(plugin :name probe :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name circle
    (key :name radius :type number :default 32)))

(circle)
